      "writtenOn": "2019-10-11T21:05:48Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "We used to return 100 for Fizz: crrev.com/c/289854. It was changed to 0 somewhere in the history.\n\nusb_get_battery_soc was in usb_common.c because usb_common.c is included by battery-less systems. I think it\u0027s ok to keep it in usb_common.c. If you want to decouple it from \u0027usb\u0027, we can probably put it in common/battery_less.c, which should be included if CONFIG_BATTERY is undefined.\n\nEach caller of get_battery_soc should handle battery less systems properly. We can blindly make get_battery_soc return 100 as a source and 0 as a sink based on a very fragile assumption.",
      "parentUuid": "400038fd_8e1efd95",
